BT /F1 10 Tf 13 TL 50 750 Td
(Wire Transfer Approval Controls) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Apex Global Bank - Payments and Treasury Operations) Tj T*
(Document ID: POL-PAY-007 | Version 2.4 | Owner: Head of Payments) Tj T*
(Illustrative policy for the Finova demo workspace. Not legal or regulatory advice.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Purpose) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This policy defines approval limits and dual-authorisation \(maker-checker\) controls for) Tj T*
(outgoing wire transfers, including RTGS, NEFT, IMPS and SWIFT cross-border payments.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Approval Limits) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Amount \(INR equivalent\) - Required approval) Tj T*
(Up to 5,00,000 - Single maker; system checks only) Tj T*
(5,00,001 to 50,00,000 - Maker plus one checker \(dual authorisation\)) Tj T*
(50,00,001 to 5,00,00,000 - Maker plus checker plus Branch or Desk Manager) Tj T*
(Above 5,00,00,000 - Maker plus checker plus Head of Payments and Treasury) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Dual-Authorisation Rules) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. The maker and checker must be two different employees. The system blocks the same user from) Tj T*
(approving their own transfer.) Tj T*
(2. The checker must independently verify the beneficiary name, account number, IFSC or SWIFT) Tj T*
(BIC, amount and purpose code against the original instruction.) Tj T*
(3. Any change to the beneficiary details after creation resets all approvals.) Tj T*
(4. Approvals expire if the transfer is not released within 4 hours.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. Cross-Border \(SWIFT\) Payments) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- All SWIFT payments are screened against sanctions lists before release.) Tj T*
(- Payments to high-risk jurisdictions require Compliance sign-off regardless of amount.) Tj T*
(- Purpose code and supporting invoice or contract are mandatory for amounts above USD 25,000) Tj T*
(equivalent.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. Callback Verification) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(For any new beneficiary or any change of beneficiary bank details on an existing payee, the) Tj T*
(bank performs a callback to the customer's registered phone number before release. Instructions) Tj T*
(received only by email are never executed without a callback.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. Cut-Off Times) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(- RTGS: 9:00 to 17:30 IST on working days.) Tj T*
(- NEFT and IMPS: 24x7.) Tj T*
(- SWIFT: instructions received after 15:00 IST are processed the next business day.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(7. Exceptions) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Exceptions to these limits require written approval from the Head of Payments and must be) Tj T*
(logged in the exception register within 24 hours.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
